{"schema_version":"benchmark-q1-semantic-issue-coverage-judgment-luna5","question_id":"Q1-semantic-issue-coverage","status":"ok","judge_run_name":"luna8-v4-medium-196-k2-horizon-high-full200-2026-09-29","prediction_set_name":"k2-horizon-high-full200-2026-09-29","paper_id":"2602.06021","judge_input_sha256":"b759df5b67de318f676e124559b2e03c7c0a306e742ed40579feba22930a57e3","gold_decisions":[{"gold_issue_id":"2602.06021:I001","focus_prediction_issue_id":"ISSUE-001","focus_relation":"different_obligation_or_hypothesis","gold_causal_unit_ids":["2602.06021:I001:U002","2602.06021:I001:U003","2602.06021:I001:U005"],"prediction_causal_unit_ids":["ISSUE-001:U001","ISSUE-001:U004","ISSUE-001:U006"],"same_causal_subject":false,"same_failed_obligation":false,"same_failure_operation":false,"identity_explanation":"The gold issue concerns an unsupported prose-level characterization of tangent-space distributions and inter-mode emergence. ISSUE-001 concerns an incorrect Gaussian-event threshold in a formal reach proof; it does not diagnose the missing characterization or the distinction between a mechanism and a characterization.","shared_mathematical_weakness":"","uncovered_gold_detail":"","coverage_status":"not_matched","supporting_prediction_issue_ids":[],"combination_explanation":"","component_coverage":[]},{"gold_issue_id":"2602.06021:I003","focus_prediction_issue_id":"ISSUE-003","focus_relation":"different_causal_subject","gold_causal_unit_ids":["2602.06021:I003:U001","2602.06021:I003:U002","2602.06021:I003:U006"],"prediction_causal_unit_ids":["ISSUE-003:U001","ISSUE-003:U002","ISSUE-003:U005"],"same_causal_subject":false,"same_failed_obligation":false,"same_failure_operation":false,"identity_explanation":"The gold issue is failure to establish spectral separation for interpreting early experimental points as a normal-distance stage. ISSUE-003 is a factor-of-two error in a softmax distance-gap bound for a ridge-existence lemma, with no diagnosis of experimental eigengap reliability.","shared_mathematical_weakness":"","uncovered_gold_detail":"","coverage_status":"not_matched","supporting_prediction_issue_ids":[],"combination_explanation":"","component_coverage":[]},{"gold_issue_id":"2602.06021:I004","focus_prediction_issue_id":"ISSUE-003","focus_relation":"different_operation_step_or_formula","gold_causal_unit_ids":["2602.06021:I004:U001","2602.06021:I004:U002","2602.06021:I004:U005"],"prediction_causal_unit_ids":["ISSUE-003:U001","ISSUE-003:U003","ISSUE-003:U005"],"same_causal_subject":false,"same_failed_obligation":false,"same_failure_operation":false,"identity_explanation":"The gold issue is that the numerical ridge estimator accepts normal-score stationary points without the required negative-curvature condition. ISSUE-003 diagnoses a separate softmax exponent constant in a fixed-point/ridge-existence argument and does not recognize the missing ridge-membership test.","shared_mathematical_weakness":"","uncovered_gold_detail":"","coverage_status":"not_matched","supporting_prediction_issue_ids":[],"combination_explanation":"","component_coverage":[]},{"gold_issue_id":"2602.06021:I005","focus_prediction_issue_id":"ISSUE-003","focus_relation":"different_operation_step_or_formula","gold_causal_unit_ids":["2602.06021:I005:U001","2602.06021:I005:U002","2602.06021:I005:U005"],"prediction_causal_unit_ids":["ISSUE-003:U001","ISSUE-003:U003","ISSUE-003:U005"],"same_causal_subject":false,"same_failed_obligation":false,"same_failure_operation":false,"identity_explanation":"The gold issue is omission of the derivative of the eigenvector field in the Jacobian of F, invalidating the Hessian-only Newton step. ISSUE-003 concerns a separate softmax ratio exponent and does not identify the product-rule contribution or the correct Jacobian.","shared_mathematical_weakness":"","uncovered_gold_detail":"","coverage_status":"not_matched","supporting_prediction_issue_ids":[],"combination_explanation":"","component_coverage":[]},{"gold_issue_id":"2602.06021:I006","focus_prediction_issue_id":"ISSUE-003","focus_relation":"different_causal_subject","gold_causal_unit_ids":["2602.06021:I006:U001","2602.06021:I006:U002","2602.06021:I006:U004"],"prediction_causal_unit_ids":["ISSUE-003:U001","ISSUE-003:U003","ISSUE-003:U005"],"same_causal_subject":false,"same_failed_obligation":false,"same_failure_operation":false,"identity_explanation":"The gold issue is the unrestricted use of an inverse spectral block without a lower-eigenvalue or conditioning safeguard. ISSUE-003 addresses a separate distance-gap exponent in a softmax estimate and does not diagnose undefined or ill-conditioned inversion.","shared_mathematical_weakness":"","uncovered_gold_detail":"","coverage_status":"not_matched","supporting_prediction_issue_ids":[],"combination_explanation":"","component_coverage":[]}],"audit":{"all_gold_ids_decided":true,"all_ranked_candidates_considered":true,"target_type_not_used_for_identity":true,"severity_not_used_for_identity":true,"prediction_reuse_requires_explicit_issue_support":true,"each_gold_credited_at_most_once":true,"combined_entries_are_self_contained_diagnoses":true,"support_limit_three_respected":true}}